# Competition DETAIL lobby — phone layout (trading)

> **BUILT 12 October 2026. Code-complete. Never verified by eye** (behind sign-in; no real-phone review yet).
>
> Dedicated tree below `md` for `/competitions/[id]` **trading** contests. Desktop stays in `DesktopTradingLobby` (`hidden md:block`); the phone tree must **not** shrink the two-column shell.
>
> **Where it lives:** `components/competitions/detail/mobile/` (`MobileTradingLobby`, `MobileTradingStats`, `MobileTradingInfo`). Wired from `app/(root)/competitions/[id]/page.tsx` with `md:hidden` / `hidden md:block`. Overview copy and rule sections are built **once** on the page and handed to both trees.
>
> | Brief part | Built as |
> |---|---|
> | Header — artwork, title, description, status | `TradingLobbyHero` + status pills (same data as desktop) |
> | Statistics — prize, entry, players, timing | `MobileTradingStats` — 2×2 `lg` cards (never desktop `showcase`); Entry fee uses `COMPETITION_ICON.entryFee` |
> | Registration | `CompetitionEntryButton` (Reserve Spot / Join Now; same eligibility / GM rules) |
> | Countdown | `LiveCountdown` in a neon panel |
> | Overview / Battle plan / rules | `MobileTradingInfo` accordion; Forex overview tile uses `COMPETITION_ICON.candles` |
> | Leaderboard | Compact `CompetitionLeaderboard` (paged) + optional live dashboard |
> | Schedule + difficulty | Schedule (UTC) rows + difficulty bar in the phone stack |
> | Winner rewards | Shared `PrizeTable` |
>
> **Rules kept:** phone never imports `CompetitionDetailShell`’s two-column grid; same loaders, entry rules, neon graphics; safe-area padding; target width 360–430px (`max-w-[430px]`).
>
> **Not built:** provider-contest phone detail tree (still uses existing provider lobby path).
>
> **Guarded by:** `__tests__/competitions/contest-lobby-shell.test.ts` (+ provider-play-ui page/sections hand-off).
>
> | Reference part | Built as |
> |---|---|
> | Header: back button, "Competition Arena" with subtitle | `MobileArenaHeader`. The back button links to `/dashboard`; the title comes from the shared `splitArenaTitle` |
> | Server Time, Balance, Add Volts | Three compact `ArenaUtilityCard`s (the shared card with a new `compact` prop). Add Volts links to `/wallet` |
> | KPI strip with dots | `MobileArenaKpis`: one tile per screen, snap scrolling, and dots you can tap. Live and Starting Soon set the status filter |
> | Search, then chips | `MobileArenaFilters`: native selects on an opaque background (R60) for Game, Assets (trading only), Difficulty, Sort and Status, plus a Clear button |
> | One card per row: 3:4 cover on the left; status and countdown, title, description and metrics on the right; Host and the button at the bottom | `MobileCompetitionCard`, built from the shared parts (`CardHero`, frame, ribbons, `CompetitionCTA`, `CompetitionStatusBadge`, `useCountdownDisplay`). Each metric shows its value beside its label, with at most six |
> | "Loading more competitions... Automatically loads 10 more items" | `MobileArenaInfiniteList`: an IntersectionObserver sentinel feeds `useMobileArenaPages`, ten items per page. It also has loading skeletons, an empty state, and a retry button on the error states |
